<Base title="About" description="Matthias Nordwig — who writes here.">
  <h1>About</h1>
  <p class="lede">I've been writing code since I was eight — C, C++, Delphi, and today mostly
  through AI agents that I direct and verify.</p>
  <p>For years I led large teams on large tasks. Among other things I rolled out KfW's regulatory
  compliance processes in more than 150 countries and designed most of the workflows behind them
  myself, which left me with something like an instinct for European banking regulation.</p>
  <p>What I'm best at is deduction: taking a problem that looks too hard, finding the one insight
  that makes it tractable, and using whatever tools exist to push it through to a result. This
  site is where I write those results down.</p>
  <p class="meta">Personal site. Views and projects here are my own and not published on behalf of
  any employer.</p>
</Base>
